            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects to apply for the rest of the turn: Blade-parry Aspect: Subtract 1 from hit rolls for combat attacks that target this unit. Destroyer Aspect: Ward rolls cannot be made for damage points inflicted by this unit's combat attacks.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic>
